#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-c-rtk2.rst:7 1c9e4ff0160d441e808cae2261ba0c40
#: 3740607c08be49e8814d1756bf1159ca cc725f403e0b43d7b45635d458106f13
#: f7292fcbd3a94d1e90d1e3a39e60c043 fc11ff2189884d3e8d7b00dad893425e
msgid ""
"C-RTK 2 is a high-performance PPK/RTK positioning module created by CUAV for"
" professional applications such as drone aerial survey/mapping). Its small "
"shape/light weight, industrial-grade IMU combination, and combination of "
"high-precision positioning modules can easily satisfy the most demanding "
"Copter/VTOL Plane/Traditional Helicopter applications."
msgstr ""
"C-RTK 2 是 CUAV 为专业应用（如无人机航测/测绘）创建的高性能 PPK/RTK 定位模块。其小巧的外形/轻重量、工业级 IMU "
"组合以及高精度定位模块的结合，可以轻松满足最苛刻的旋翼机/VTOL 固定翼/传统直升机应用需求。"

